# Avoid uploading node_modules or module builds to the container because we install and build everything there
**/node_modules
**/build
# Never send an environment file to the builder: a working tree holds local secrets in them. The templates stay.
# The exception must follow the patterns it overrides.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# The infrastructure code is not part of the image, and provider binaries under it would bloat the build context.
infra
